{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん温かいコメントを\n本当に本当にありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸がいっぱいになる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の支えです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今週末、握手会で沢山の方に会えて、\nコメントで沢山の応援していただいて、\n元気をもらえました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの力って偉大だな、\nと改めて思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/07/6199269/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってくれている皆さんのために"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しずつになってしまいますが\nブログ更新出来たらなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も前へ進まなきゃね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/07/6199269/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握でペアだったかりん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりんと一緒にいる時間が長くなって\n後輩とは思えないくらいに\n仲良くなれました。らぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のんびり待っていてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/05/07/6199269/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}